                                                "sense_id": "3d348781-6a03-3267-82ee-a72ec53d4344",
                                                "text": "Her conversation, I soon found, was couched in the telegraphic style. “Weeds grow like house afire. Can’t keep even with ’em. Shall press you in. Better be careful.”"
                                            },
